;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K87
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;ついでに名前登録も
	;expanded a bit
	PRINTFORMW A tall woman suddenly approaches you with a massive spear in her hand.
	PRINTFORMW An enemy?! But she seems strangely excited to see you for some reason... Doesn't seem like she'd attack.
	PRINTFORML 「Ah, yes-yes! I have heard of you, you must be the new disciple, correct? Welcome to Myouren Temple!」
	IF MAIN_MAP != 1 ;in case you're not a temple dweller which is almost guaranteed since this dialogue was ported from another game
		PRINTFORMW 「...Eh, you're not?! Wait a minute... My notes must be slightly out of date, then.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm terribly sorry for this mishap! I made a fool of myself just now, didn't I?」
		PRINTFORMW She says, bowing humbly before you in apology.
		PRINTFORMW 「I'd like to make it up to you. Allow me to introduce myself...」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMW 「I am Shou Toramaru, acting on behalf of Bishamonten-sama who is enshrined in the temple. An avatar, if you will.」
	SIF CFLAG:39:面識
		PRINTFORMW Oh... So she must be the "Master" Nazrin mentioned, huh?
	PRINTFORMW You decide to check out this "avatar" for a moment as she speaks.
	PRINTFORMW She has orange spiky hair with black stripes, yellow eyes with slit pupils, and sharp-looking teeth.
	PRINTFORMW She also has a flower ornament on her head. Speaking of her head... Does she dye her hair?
	PRINTFORMW No, the waist of her dress repeats the pattern. Her body also seems to be well endowed underneath.
	PRINTFORMW She must be a youkai... A well-spoken and polite one at that.
	PRINTFORML 「\@ MAIN_MAP != 1 ? But since we will be sharing the same place, # Still,\@ feel free to come and talk to me if you have any questions.」
	PRINTFORML 「That would make us feel a lot more comfortable with each other.」
	PRINTFORMW She finishes with a gentle chuckle.
	PRINTFORMW 「Now, I'd like to hear your name if you please.」
	CALL NAME_SET_K87 ;custom
	PRINTFORMW 「Then once again, %MASTERNAME:87%-san.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I look forward to \@ MAIN_MAP != 1 ? your company # working with you\@ from now on!」

RETURN 1

